---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="TubeCalc — Lab Calculators"
  desc="Flagship solution preparation calculator: enter stock and final concentrations, get each component's amount automatically, with multiple solvents and powder weighing; plus molecular weight, protein analysis and dilution tools."
  note=""
  lic="App icon based on Microsoft Fluent Emoji (MIT License)"
>

<main class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Complex mixtures, made simple</h1>
    <p>Flagship &middot; Solution Preparation Calculator: stock and final concentrations in, each component's amount out &mdash; pick your solvent, weigh powders directly, copy TSV into your spreadsheet.</p>
    <p>Lightweight, free, no sign-up &mdash; built for everyday lab calculations.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn hero-btn" href="/en/tools/mix/">Open the solution preparation calculator &rarr;</a>
      <a class="hero-more" href="#tools">Browse all tools</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="tool-card featured" href="/en/tools/mix/">
    <span class="featured-tag">Featured</span>
    <h3>Solution Preparation Calculator</h3>
    <p>Plan a whole reaction setup at once: stock &rarr; final concentration gives each component's amount automatically, solvent tops up the volume, and any edit recalculates instantly.</p>
    <ul class="feat-list">
      <li>All units: M/mM/&mu;M, &times; concentrates, % v/v, % w/v, g/mol powder weighing</li>
      <li>Solvent choice: water, ethanol, DMSO, glycerol and more, with mass reference</li>
      <li>Autosaves in your browser; one-click TSV copy into Excel</li>
    </ul>
    <span class="open">Open &rarr;</span>
  </a>
  <h2 class="sec-title" id="tools">All tools</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="tool-card" href="/en/tools/protein/">
      <h3>Protein Sequence Analysis</h3>
      <p>Molecular weight, theoretical pI, extinction coefficient &epsilon;<sub>280</sub>, A280, amino acid composition and the GRAVY hydropathy index.</p>
      <span class="open">Open &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/en/tools/mw/">
      <h3>Molecular Weight Calculator</h3>
      <p>Type a formula (parentheses and hydrates supported, e.g. CuSO4·5H2O) to get molar mass and elemental composition.</p>
      <span class="open">Open &rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</main>
</Layout>
